+        # field for field -- nVersion, hashPrevouts, hashSequence,
+        # outpoint, scriptCode, value, nSequence, hashOutputs, nLocktime,
+        # sighashType, double-SHA256'd -- once hashtype carries the
+        # FORKID bit (BCH_SIGHASH_FORKID = 0x41, defined at module scope
